Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 24
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800
Set TypingSpeed 70ms

Sleep 2s
Type "runpage examples/showcase.md"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Down@100ms 35
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down@200ms 16
Sleep 2s
Enter
Down@200ms 16
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down@200ms 4
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+D

